{"id":"661360","name":"蛋炒饭","author":"双鱼座的美食","authorId":"11350065","desc":"","cover":"images/661360/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"剩米饭","amount":"一碗"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"米饭剩一天以上的更好，颗粒分明，葱花多些，要嫩葱。","img":"images/661360/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡蛋打散。","img":"images/661360/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"剩米饭按压一下，成一粒一粒的。","img":"images/661360/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"葱花，嫩葱好吃。","img":"images/661360/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"热油炒蛋，微热后就放蛋液。","img":"images/661360/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"稍定型就用搅动，炒出是嫩的。","img":"images/661360/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"热油下葱花。","img":"images/661360/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"爆香，下米饭，爆火。","img":"images/661360/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"炒个三五分钟，有的饭粒上火候。","img":"images/661360/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加盐，鸡蛋，香油翻炒出锅。","img":"images/661360/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"原图。","img":"images/661360/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"美图。","img":"images/661360/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}